      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 1317718922,
      "text": "Diospyros maritima is a tree in the family Ebenaceae. The specific epithet maritima means 'by the sea', referring to the tree's habitat."
    }
